\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS- \highlight22\uc2 Hungary intervention \highlight\uc2  seen as wise move. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Peter S. Serenyi \par \uc2 437 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 1998\par 18:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, Aug 28 (Reuters) - The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (NBH) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the forint on Friday was an inexpensive way to show investors that it will defend the Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "This is the best strategy possible right now," said Zoltan Kurali, analyst at BNP-Dresdner Securities in Budapest, estimating the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had cost $50 million. \par \par \uc2  He said the moves protected the forint against outflows of speculative money from Hungary. \par \par \uc2  "It is not huge in the greater scheme of things," said John Lomax, analyst at HSBC Investment Services, referring to the size of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "\b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  clearly has plenty of reserves to cope with that." \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  three times in morning trade when the forint fell to about 2.0 percent below parity, still within the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 4.5-percent-wide \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  The NBH stepped in again in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  The measures bolstered the forint to finish at 1.7 percent below parity, compared with Thursday's close of two percent below midline. \par \par \uc2  "They didn't want to wait until it would be too late or too costly to protect the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Peter Bihari, analyst at Budapest Bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated the day's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at up to $100 million. \par \par \uc2  The moves may not be enough, however, to prevent a forint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "A lot depends on how the situation in Russia develops," said Lomax. "If events get materially worse, then there is a very real chance of a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis in Hungary." \par \par \uc2  The forint was among the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  which suffered from Russia's financial crisis although the government and analysts have said Hungarian business was not closely tied to Russia. \par \par \uc2  The forint fell to record lows this week as foreign investors withdrew funds from Hungarian stocks and bonds to cover losses they suffered amid Russia's crisis. \par \par \uc2  The Budapest Stock Exchange's BUX index closed at 5,167.71 points on Friday, down by 300.25 points from Thursday and by 42.7 percent below its all-time high reached on April 23. \par \par \uc2  Government securities yields have been rising this month and continued to do so on Friday, with the Government Debt Management Agency's benchmark yields rising by between 58 and 112 basis points. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the NBH declared the result of its one-year bonds' auction unvalid on Friday, probably to avoid an excessive rise in yields on the securities. \par \par \uc2  ((Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327 4048 budapest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8s01ql7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
