\par\par \b \uc2  Hungarian Forint Steady Midmorning;  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Not In Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 318 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 August 1998\par 10:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is steady at midmorning Thursday, with no sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 0825 GMT, the forint was at 1.3% from the midpoint on the weak side of its trading band, essentially unchanged from 1.25% in late trading Wednesday, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the afternoon to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allows the forint to move a maximum 2.25% on either side of the midpoint, which is fixed using a basket of 30% dollar and 70% Deutsche mark. The bank devalues the forint by 0.8% against the basket each month. \par \par \uc2  "For the moment, we haven't seen the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at ABN Amro (Magyar) Bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  The dealer noted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't enter the market at the start of trading when the forint weakened to a low of around HUF228.00 to the dollar, although she said traders are still on guard, especially since foreigners unnerved by Russia's economic crisis continue to sell the forint in moderate quantities. \par \par \uc2  Around 0825 GMT, the dollar was at HUF226.60-226.90, up from HUF226.30-226.70 at Wednesday's close. The mark was at HUF125.53-125.58, down from HUF126.10-126.15. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the forint Wednesday at HUF226.00 to the dollar, up from HUF224.86 Tuesday. It fixed the forint at HUF125.53 to the mark Wednesday, up from HUF125.08 Tuesday. Thursday's fixing will be released after 1000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three-month interbank forint offered rates were indicated at 16.45% Wednesday. Thursday's rates will be released shortly. \par \par \uc2  -By Jack Grone; 36-1-267-0622; jgrone@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 27-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0848GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8r07dke\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
