\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary's Suranyi Calls Thu Forint Movements Normal - MTI \b0\par\par\uc2 213 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 August 1998\par 18:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (Dow Jones)--National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Gyorgy Suranyi said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Thursday because the movements of the Hungarian forint "didn't exceed usual levels," state news agency MTI reported. \par \par \uc2  Suranyi made the comments one day after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  staged its first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market since 1995 to support the battered forint, which has been weakened as investors pull money out of Hungary due to the crisis in neighboring Russia. \par \par \uc2  The forint's record lows Thursday prompted many \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers to fear a new round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At the close of regular trading in Budapest at around 1300 GMT, the forint was at a record low of about 2.00% from the midpoint on the weak side of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band, softer from 1.3% at midmorning and also weaker from 1.25% at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  On the soft side of the band, a higher percentage means the forint is weaker. \par \par \uc2  Under the terms of the current exchange rate regime, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is obligated to buy forints when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaches 2.25% from the midpoint on the band. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 27-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1640GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8r07biy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
