\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary \highlight\uc2  c. bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  to protect forint. \b0\par\par\uc2 316 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 1998\par 15:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, Aug 26 (Reuters) - The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBH) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at least twice on Wednesday to protect the forint, dealers said, adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  happened while the Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was within its 4.5-percent-wide band. \par \par \uc2  "First the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  came only to inquire about prices but did not strike (any deals)," one dealer said. "Later it entered the market via both brokers and the direct market, I think twice." \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought forints three times between 1130 GMT and 1230 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  came when the forint traded at around 1.5 to 1.6 percent below parity, a safe distance from the weaker end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  At the time of the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  the forint traded at between 226.30 and 226.50 to the dollar, and the move pushed it up to around 226.00. \par \par \uc2  The forint closed at 226.30/80, compared with Tuesday's end at 225.20/40, while against the basket it finished at around 1.40 percent below parity as compared with Tuesday's close at 1.15 percent under the midrange. \par \par \uc2  The NBH said on Monday it was ready to enter the interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to protect the forint, which has fluctuated wildly within the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band in the past few days. \par \par \uc2  The NBH said at that time that the direction and size of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements within the forint's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band exceeded the desired level and resulted in an unjustified uncertainty on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its possible move would take place within the framework of the current exchange rate system, and any steps would be temporary and would not signal a change in Hungary's monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  ((Emese Bartha, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4047 budapest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8q01kgl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
