\par\par \b \uc2  CORRECTED -  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary \highlight\uc2  cbank says  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to calm mkt. \b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 1998\par 16:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  In BUDAPEST story headlined '\b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  cbank says \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to calm mkt', please read in fifth paragraph ...The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the forint stood at around 227.00 to the dollar... instead of ...The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the forint stood at 217.00 to the dollar... (Corrects figure). \par \par \uc2  A corrected version follows. \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, Aug 26 (Reuters) - The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBH) said it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday to reduce forint fluctuations that it said were unjustified by domestic economic fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  "The main reason for the current \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was to soothe the exaggerated exchange rate movements unjustified by macroeconomic indicators," NBH managing director Adam Farkas told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "On the other hand, we wanted to lend confidence to the market," he said. \par \par \uc2  Farkas did not exclude that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again if Wednesday's move does not calm the market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the forint stood around 227.00 (CORRECTS) to the dollar, compared with Tuesday's close of 225.20/40, he said. \par \par \uc2  The forint was within the 4.5-percent-wide \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band when the NBH acted. \par \par \uc2  "If the forint reaches either end of the band, where we have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we do \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. "Besides that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  anywhere within the band." \par \par \uc2  Farkas declined to disclose how much foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  the bank spent on supporting the forint. \par \par \uc2  Hungary's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves stood at 9.63 billion at the end of June, the latest figure available, compared with first half imports of 10.48 billion. \par \par \uc2  ((Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4044 budapest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8q01kjx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
