\par\par \b \uc2  WRAP:  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk Seen  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  Again To Buoy Forint \b0\par\par\uc2  By Jack Grone \par \uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 1998\par 17:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (Dow Jones)--Expect further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to support the forint (HUF) as long as it remains prone to selling pressure from foreigners, dealers said Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Their remarks came after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the forint for the first time since early 1995. \par \par \uc2  But the effort wasn't overly successful, and the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to weaken in the next days, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been pushed to record lows against the dollar and the Deutsche mark this week as foreigners sell the forint to cover their losses in Russia's crisis-ridden economy. In particular, offshore investors have been selling Hungarian shares. The Budapest Stock Exchange's benchmark BUX index fell 5.7% Wednesday, closing at 6386.36 points, its lowest level in nine months. \par \par \uc2  "There are more buyers on the lower levels to buy dollars and marks against the forint, so the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have to make another \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  soon, maybe (Thursday)," said a dealer at a foreign-owned bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  At the end of local trading Wednesday, the mark stood at HUF126.10-.15, up from HUF125.54-.59 at midday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar, however, had weakened somewhat, to HUF226.30-70, down from HUF227.20-.30 just prior to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and also lower from HUF226.50-.95 at midday. \par \par \uc2  Wednesday's action wasn't a surprise to many market observers, especially after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  warned Monday that it stood ready to defend the forint. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 26-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1520GMT \par \par \uc2  1195 4208 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8q07al7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
