\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary forint opens steady vs basket, up vs dlr. \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juni 1998\par 11:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, June 5 (Reuters) - Hungary's forint opened steady against the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket and firmer against the dollar on Friday in slow trade, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "There's really nothing going on," said Gabor Butor, a dealer at Raiffeisen Unicbank, adding that the approaching weekend had depressed volume. \par \par \uc2  "There is slight buying interest, but...many players are off the market and the dollar/mark international market is extremely slow as well." \par \par \uc2  The forint opened at 1.7 above parity in the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (NBH) 4.5-percent-wide \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, steady with Thursday's close of 1.75 percent above parity, Butor said. \par \par \uc2  Against the dollar the forint opened at 212.00 and was quoted slightly weaker at 212.15/25 at 0840 GMT, but firmer compared to Thursday's close of 212.20/50, following the dollar/mark cross on international markets. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said tension on Hungary's markets was easing as the financial situation seemed to have stabilised for the time being, while reports about prospective key members of Hungary's new rightist government were reassuring. \par \par \uc2  Fidesz Hungarian Civic Party, which won the elections on May 24 over the ruling Socialists, has said it will continue the country's strict economic policies and is expected to set up a rightist coalition government in the next few weeks. \par \par \uc2  ((Daniel Langenkamp, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4043 budapest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6503kn7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
