\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary \highlight\uc2 's Ctrl Bk Says Won't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  Within Forint Band \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1998\par 18:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of Hungary said in a news release Thursday it sees no reason to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market while the Hungarian forint remains within the trading band established by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The bank's statement, which confirms a spokesman's comments earlier Thursday to Dow Jones Newswires, came after the forint's most volatile day of trading since the present exchange-rate regime was launched in 1995. \par \par \uc2  After the forint weakened steadily throughout the morning on foreign-driven selling, it surged upward against the dollar and Deutsche mark early in the afternoon. That led to speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the forint. The bank denied the rumors around 1200 GMT. \par \par \uc2  The forint never left the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's midpoint, which is fixed using a basket of western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The (forint's) movement from the edge of the band, related to the market's mood and a large payment of a bill for imports, can be considered temporary," the bank said. \par \par \uc2  "The strengthening of (Hungary's) external accounts, the development of inflation and interest rates, and the country's economic achievements give no reason for the bank to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market within the forint's trading band," the bank said. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 28-05-98 \par \par \uc2  1601GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5s04l4h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
