\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary central bank \highlight\uc2  may  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  - analysts. \b0\par\par\uc2 376 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1998\par 13:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, May 28 (Reuters) - The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBH) may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to protect the forint by selling dollars if the Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to weaken and dips below the parity level, market participants said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "If we cross midrange, they (the NBH) are likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," BNP-Dresdner Securities analyst Zoltan Kurali said. "(But) for the time being, I think the NBH won't do anything," he added. \par \par \uc2  The forint ended the morning session at a historic low at 0.3 percent above parity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 4.5 percent wide \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, down from Wednesday's close of 1.44 percent, due to panic speculation in an illiquid market. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the forint had weakened because Russia's financial crisis and problems on other emerging markets added to the uncertainty of foreign investors over the policy of the new government to be set up in Hungary. \par \par \uc2  "There is some profit repatriation, mainly on the fixed income market," said Norbert Toth of ING Barings, adding that it was the spill-over effect of speculation with the Russian rouble. \par \par \uc2  Kurali added that the weakening of the forint in the past few weeks over uncertainty around Hungary's elections held on Sunday had caused losses to foreign investors. \par \par \uc2  Centre-right Fidesz Hungarian Civic Party won the elections over the ruling Socialists and is expected to form a government with two other rightist parties in the next few weeks. \par \par \uc2  "There is some uncertainty," said Kurali. "They (the parties) may not get to an agreement quickly." \par \par \uc2  Kurali said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unlikely to raise its interest rates to stabilise the market as it would contradict its 25 basis point cuts in four repo rates on Monday, which was underpinned with positive macroeconomic figures. \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may prevent an excessive weakening of the forint by selling dollar on the market, which would not cause any problem to the NBH as Hungary's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were high. \par \par \uc2  He added the NBH may also reintroduce fixing the yield on its one-year bonds so as to offer attractive yield levels to investors. \par \par \uc2  ((Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4044 budapest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du5s04cte\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
