\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary \highlight\uc2  forint rebounds,c.bank denies  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Sandor Peto \par \uc2 386 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1998\par 21:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, May 28 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's forint fell more than one percent to an historic low against its parity basket before partly recovering on Thursday prompting the national bank to deny reports it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The forint closed at one percent above parity within the 4.5 percent wide \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range, rebounding from an all-time low of 0.3 percent above midrange. \par \par \uc2  Against the dollar, the forint ended at 213.82/214.20, down from Wednesday's close of 211.50/60. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling dollars to support the Hungarian unit but the NBH denied it taken any such action. \par \par \uc2  "The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  denies that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the forint," the NBH said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  Some traders said the NBH was on the market for a short period at around 1100 GMT, selling foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  All traders agreed the forint rebounded due to a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling deal, which was relatively small but had a strong impact as the market had been illiquid. \par \par \uc2  "In our estimate, (the deal) was not larger than $20 million," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The NBH said it had no reason for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the forint stopped falling without reaching midrange, while economic factors did not justify a weakening of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The improvement of the external balance, the trend (of decline) in inflation and interest rates and the country's economic performance do not justify that the NBH should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the flotation band," the NBH said. \par \par \uc2  It said the forint traded in an illiquid market on Wednesday and its movement was temporary. \par \par \uc2  "The movement off the end of the band is in relation with the market atmosphere and the payment of a larger import bill, and can be regarded as temporary," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  Participants said the fall was due to market uncertainty caused by Russia's current economic woes and financial problems in other emerging markets. \par \par \uc2  Also the market has been concerned about possible changes in economic policy in Hungary, where a centre-right coalition will take over from the outgoing Socialists as soon as official election results are published, probably next week. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du5s044k1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
