\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary O/N rates flat, forint seen down vs basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 1998\par 09:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  0710 - Hungarian overnight rates ended steady on Monday at 18.00/125 percent, unaffected by the victory of the opposition Fidesz Hungarian Civic Party in Hungarian general elections on Sunday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  * Traders did, however, expect a weakening of the forint because of the uncertainty caused by the opposition victory. \par \par \uc2  * Traders said they expected the forint to weaken this week from 1.8 percent to a maximum of 1.5 percent above parity in the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, down from Friday's close at 1.95 percent above parity. \par \par \uc2  * The market was quiet and cautious in tight liquidity, traders said. \par \par \uc2  * Traders said they expected less of the weakening to happen Monday than on Tuesday and Wednesday because of bank holidays in both London and the United States on Monday, though volatility was expected because of the tight liquidity. \par \par \uc2  * Hungarian regulations stipulate that trading can only be conducted for days when both home markets of those \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are open. \par \par \uc2  * At the market opening at 0700 GMT, the forint was quoted at 210.25/35 to the dollar, slightly down from Friday's close at 210.10/15 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  * The forint floats against a basket made up of 30 percent dollar and 70 percent German mark, within the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 4.5-percent-wide \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range. \par \par \uc2  * The National Bank fixed the forint at 209.96 to the dollar on Friday. \par \par \uc2  (Full reports to follow.). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du5p04ktp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
