\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary's Markets/FIDESZ -3: Forint Seen Weakening Monday \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 1998\par 00:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Furjes estimated that the Hungarian forint, already weakened in recent days by capital outflows from the stock exchange, is likely to weaken further on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps a tight grip on the forint's movements by allowing it to trade in a narrow range against a basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The forint is allowed to move a maximum of 2.25% from midpoints against the dollar and Deutsche mark as set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Late Friday the forint was at 1.95% on the strong side of the band in highly illiquid trade. Furjes said the forint could weaken to 1.50% Monday, and that the political uncertainty expected to dominate Hungary over the next couple of weeks will keep trading volatile. \par \par \uc2  The forint hasn't been so weak since it came under pressure last fall from Asia's economic crises. \par \par \uc2  If the forint weakens to 0.0% on the band (the midpoint), traders said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  could even \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Pal Szucs, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Hypo Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Active \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is exceedingly rare on\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hungary\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's normally drowsy \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market. The bank last actively\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the market in November 1995 to support the forint at 1.50%\par on the strong side of the band.\par    -By Jack Grone and Margit Feher; 361-267-0622\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-05-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2210GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5o04eqe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
