\par\par \b \uc2  HUNGARY'S FORINT ENDS FIRMER VS BASKET ON OPTIMISM. \b0\par\par\uc2 354 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, Dec 16 (Reuters) - Hungary's forint ended firmer against the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Tuesday as an expected \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying wave on the futures market did not materialise, indicating optimism over the strength of the forint, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Many speculators, including corporates, sold (\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures) hoping that this will improve their positions next year," said Balazs Benczedi of WestLB Hungaria. "They expect the forint to firm and also the monthly (one percent) devaluator will be cut (to 0.9 percent on January 1.)" \par \par \uc2  "December futures positions were turned into next year positions," he added. \par \par \uc2  The forint finished at 2.2 percent above parity within the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 4.5 percent wide floating \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, compared with the opening two percent, which was also Monday's closing level. \par \par \uc2  Against the dollar, however, it ended lower, at 201.44/49, compared with Monday's close of 201.01/11, reflecting the dollar's strength against the mark, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said Tuesday's firming against the basket, comprising 30 percent dollars and 70 percent marks, brought the forint close to levels where it usually traded before the recent uncertainty on Asian markets weakened it. \par \par \uc2  The forint has lingered at levels around two percent above parity in the past two weeks. \par \par \uc2  According to market talk, several players had seen the forint weakening further because they expected a large-scale \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying for the days before the maturing of December \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures on the Budapest Commodity Exchange on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  They bought \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the forint was two percent above parity, hoping to sell it when the forint eased versus the basket, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But the forint did not weaken as players closing December futures immediately reinvested their funds in 1998 maturities such as March and June, and this also triggered closings of earlier loss-making speculative long positions, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "This means (market players) are maximally optimistic over the forint's future," Benczedi said. \par \par \uc2  ((Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4044 \par \par \uc2  budapest.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  REUTERS SPO DSH \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040131dtcg013gc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
