\par\par \b \uc2  Hungarian forint steady vs basket, weaker vs dlr. \b0\par\par\uc2 196 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, Dec 8 (Reuters) - Hungary's forint opened steady against the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Monday but weaker against the dollar due to the mark's weakening versus the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At the opening, the forint was quoted at 201.55/60 to the dollar, down from Friday's closing 200.40/45. \par \par \uc2  Against the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, it opened 2.04 percent above parity, little changed from 2.05 percent above parity at Friday's close. \par \par \uc2  The forint trades in the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (NBH) 4.5 percent wide \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range, against a basket comprising 30 percent dollars and 70 percent marks. \par \par \uc2  The forint is expected to remain steady against the NBH basket, but an increase in demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  may weaken it, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "I don't expect (the forint) to move much into either directions," said Gabor Butor of Raiffeisen Unicbank. \par \par \uc2  "If it moves, I expect it to weaken," he added. "It has been reacting sensitively to buying recently." \par \par \uc2  ((Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4044 budapest.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtc801gwa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
