\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Rebounds Vs Basket In Early Active Trade \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Oktober 1997\par 10:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is strengthening against its fixing basket early Wednesday from its levels at Tuesday midday, supported by rebounds on U.S. and Asian equities markets, with the forint seen remaining stable at current levels. \par \par \uc2  'The forint is trading steadily at the same level, following the dollar and the Deutsche mark as usual in active and normal trade,' said dealer Andras Szanto at the European Commercial Bank (EKB) in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  Around 915 GMT the forint was trading 1.97% above its midpoint on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, battered by the flight from equities in Hungary and elsewhere, the forint weakened to within 0.5% of the midpoint but still remained on the strong side of the band. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they hadn't seen the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at such a weak level since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  introduced its current exchange rate regime in early 1995. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5% allows the forint to move 2.25% either way from the midpoint, and usually the forint trades within one or two basis points from its strongest point. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses a fixing basket made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark to establish the band. \par \par \uc2  Wednesday morning, the forint is trading in a relatively wide range of 10-20 basis points, but trade is as normal otherwise, Szanto noted. \par \par \uc2  At around 915 GMT, the dollar was at 195.50-195.55 forints, up from 195.42-195.47 forints midday Tuesday. The mark was at 112.29-112.34 forints, down from 113.09-113.14 forints. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0929GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtat088h7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
