\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Down Slightly Vs Basket On Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Oktober 1997\par 10:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  turmoil in Hong Kong and elsewhere in Asia spilled over into Hungary Monday, with the Hungarian forint weakening slightly against its fixing basket in active trade, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But by midmorning Monday the market had already started to quiet down, and the forint was still well on the strong side of the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  The band allows the forint to move 2.25% either way from the bank's midpoint, which is established using a fixing basket of 30% dollar and 70% Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  'The forint is trading 15 to 20 fillers from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bid but it is rather like a reflex action to the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crises with trading moods already quieting,' said dealer Ervin Csengeri at Inter-Europa Bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  There are 100 fillers in a forint. Usually the forint trades within a couple of fillers from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bid. \par \par \uc2  Csengeri added that foreign funds investing in emerging markets were buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and selling forints through the banks at opening. The Hong Kong panic was a one-day affair with its fundamental causes in the Asian regions which don't apply in Hungary, Csengeri said. \par \par \uc2  The forint market was closed for national holidays Thursday and Friday, meaning Monday's session is the first in which the forint has had a chance to react to the developments in Hong Kong in recent days. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0938GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtar0837e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
